# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 7 as ruled (round 3 ST: a gathered dynamic moves at n+1, an owed tick; at the build it reads the rows built above it) and ch. 9 (a place's first value is read in its birth tick; an event answer is the next tick's input, owed; round 3 DY: a dynamic answer's change is a push delivered the next tick, owed): the plain part is the first value's; the click's event part is heard in tick 2; the row born in tick 1 moves the gathered dynamic in tick 2, heard in tick 3.
test a_plain_part_beside_a_structural_part

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="add")
    1/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="one")
    2/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="7 1: none")

tick 1
  in:
    0: click
  added:
    1/[2]/0: Ui.Label(text="two")

tick 2
  changed:
    2/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="7 1: hello")

tick 3
  changed:
    2/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="7 2: hello")
